 "description": "This is the first deck of four. The first four I've made in nearly 3 years.",
 "strategy": "(first off i can't spell for the life of me so bear with me)\n\nThese are the first decks I've mad in three years and this is the first of my four deck series.\n\nYour starting System is Ralltir and you should try to deploy that first and Dantooine last. Dantooine is the only system that dosen't have a dark side force icon and this will hopfully cause your opponint to think this is your hidden base(little bit of phsycological warfair). Use REBEL FLEET and IT COULD BE WORSE to slow down force drain and help absorbe battle damage. once you have all the X-WINGS out use ALL WINGS REPORT IN and get back that eight force.\n\nTry to get VERRACK on the DEFIANCE and if you can manage it don't deploy S-FOILS until RED LEAER IN RED 1 is on table. Use luke to get DARKLIGHTER SPIN in to hand and have him be retriving 1 fore a turn as much as possible.\n\nSince this is one of my first decks that I've made in 3 years I would appriciate as much feed back as possibel. BE BRUTAL I CAN TAKE IT!",
